    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scope X is a lightweight zoom and focus tool designed to enhance visual clarity across your entire display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly toggle magnification, create a personalized focus ring, and fine-tune sensitivity controls\u2014all from one easy-to-use overlay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Magnification</strong> \u2013 Instantly zoom in or out on any part of your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configurable Controls</strong> \u2013 Customize keyboard and mouse shortcuts to suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Ring Design</strong> \u2013 Adjust the color, size, and transparency of your visual marker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong> \u2013 Seamlessly runs alongside other apps and games with zero integrations or dependencies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlay-Based Zoom</strong> \u2013 Utilizes screen rendering technology similar to recording and accessibility software. No game modifications, no interference.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scope X is a lightweight zoom and focus tool designed to enhance visual clarity across your entire display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly toggle magnification, create a personalized focus ring, and fine-tune sensitivity controls\u2014all from one easy-to-use overlay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Magnification</strong> \u2013 Instantly zoom in or out on any part of your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configurable Controls</strong> \u2013 Customize keyboard and mouse shortcuts to suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Ring Design</strong> \u2013 Adjust the color, size, and transparency of your visual marker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong> \u2013 Seamlessly runs alongside other apps and games with zero integrations or dependencies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlay-Based Zoom</strong> \u2013 Utilizes screen rendering technology similar to recording and accessibility software. No game modifications, no interference.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Scope X aims to be the #1 visual accessibility tool for PC gamers. Instantly magnify any part of your screen to reveal critical details in any game or application.",
